{"data":{"body":"[P2] Loading recomputes the expected filename using the current `pathEncoding`. An in-flight execution that wrote a URI-form reference will therefore fail replay after configuration changes to `HASH`, despite the persisted reference, owner, and digest remaining valid. Make encoding a write-only choice by accepting both versioned filename formats during load, or persist the encoding with the reference, and add a cross-configuration replay test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pplSd","finding_digest":"d0a9831d119bc5eca686bcbbd7eb0676b92be8bc6a81712c244803e6014f0fde","finding_id":"arf_v1_2cuyghirtpc6zjugxs55p2ygo2","finding_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::validatepayloadpath::encoding-independent-replay","identity_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::validatepayloadpath::encoding-independent-replay","line":200,"observation_digest":"422d5b9b033a652a6c80b2269c053acd3cba11767bec6f78986c0a7b6931bb2f","observation_id":"aro_v1_iiwvxgydhjssu3eawitjybj2zu","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/filesystem/FileSystemPayloadOffloader.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:41:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fxd2azzpefqbkxdrbguqhvpfz4","reviewed_base_sha":"a52a63745d2f0ef2031adef2aeb872568f0fafbf","reviewed_head_sha":"578208f0b55d4110cb89acd77a1e5923488e80d6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":197,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":681},"record_id":"art_v1_mfjhtseeezraw6ovauv27hcooy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:41:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
